<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Graph-Computing - Category -</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/graph-computing/</link><description/><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 29 Nov 2024 23:13:27 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/graph-computing/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Runtime</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</link><pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 14:41:40 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/runtime/</guid><category domain="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/graph-computing/">Graph-Computing</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在主板上增加 PLX 芯片以提供更多的 PCIe 通道&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PCIe 设备插到 PCIe 插槽需要由 PLX 芯片提供支持&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一个PCIe插槽在物理层面上确实只能插入一个设备。例如，你只能插入一张显卡或一块SSD到一个PCIe插槽中。但是通过PLX芯片等交换设备，可以让多个PCIe设备通过该插槽共享带宽并同时被RC识别和使用(PLX芯片实际上是在分配带宽，这并没有改变某一时刻 RC 只会和某个插槽上的一台设备进行通信的事实，对于资源有限的PCIe插槽环境比较有意义）&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Legion Source Code Analysis</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/legion-source-code-analysis/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Mar 2024 20:17:06 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/graph-computing/legion-source-code-analysis/</guid><category domain="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/graph-computing/">Graph-Computing</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="项目文件分类"&gt;&lt;span&gt;项目文件分类&lt;/span&gt;
